<%- include('partials/top') %>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Watch our farm friends live. Give them a treat from anywhere.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Eight paddocks of horses, a coop full of chickens and a shack of ducks on our 80-acre farm, streaming all day. Members tap a button and a real treat drops while you watch.</p>
    <p><a class="btn" href="<%= locals.me ? '/cams' : '/register' %>"><%= locals.me ? 'Go to the live cams' : 'Become a member' %></a></p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="wrap steps">
  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <ol class="cards">
    <li><h3>Join</h3><p>Sign up for a membership to unlock every live camera on the farm.</p></li>
    <li><h3>Pick a friend</h3><p>Choose a paddock, the chicken coop or the duck shack and watch them live.</p></li>
    <li><h3>Feed them</h3><p>Each treat is $1. Tap Feed and watch it land in the trough a few seconds later.</p></li>
  </ol>
  <p class="note">Every station has a daily treat limit set with our vet. When it&rsquo;s reached, you&rsquo;ll see &ldquo;They&rsquo;ve had plenty of treats today. Come back tomorrow!&rdquo;</p>
</section>
<%- include('partials/bottom') %>
